        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grade 1 Key-In-Lever Adaptor Ring, DJO-AR-335</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Don-Jo Grade 1 Lever Door Thickness Adaptor Ring is for use with commercial grade 1 key in levers that don't accommodate 1-3/8 inch thick doors. Just install 2 of these to help a lever that will normally fit a 1-3/4 inch thick door. By adding the extra space, a lever normally used for a thicker door can now be used on a thinner door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b>of the Don-Jo Polished Brass Adaptor Ring:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Diameter: 3.5\"</li>\r\n<li>Cut-out Diameter: 2.125\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSold Individually. If you are using to adjust a lever meant for 1-3/4\" thick doors to a door that is 1-3/8\" thick, you will need to buy 2.</b>\r\n</p>",
